# The Construct — Vite environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored). EVERYTHING here is optional: with no file at
# all the game boots, signs you in, and opens the Setup wizard, which creates
# your org + app and remembers the app id in this browser.
#
# DO NOT put a hostname in this file. The installed CrowdyJS dist-tag already
# carries the correct public API origin for its tier (`latest` -> production);
# a hostname written here goes stale the first time the fleet moves.

# Pin the app this checkout plays. When set, the Setup wizard is skipped unless
# you open it from the HUD. Takes an app id from your own org (see README).
# VITE_APP_ID=

# Override the API origin (root, no /graphql). Only for a private deployment or
# a local API stack; leave unset to use the SDK's baked default for its tier.
# VITE_CROWDY_HTTP_URL=

# Enable/disable CLIENT-target Crowdy Studio mods in this build (default: on).
# A fork that wants SERVER-only Studio sets this to 0.
# VITE_CONSTRUCT_CLIENT_MODS=1

# App-token refresh cadence in seconds (default 1200 = 20 min; tokens live ~30).
# VITE_APP_TOKEN_REFRESH_SECONDS=1200
